{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' schemas/v1/agent-skill-v1.schema.json\nsed -n '1,180p' schemas/v1/common.schema.json\ngit show 57c1f56846d221ecc55786bd3c2467ec32f11730:protocol/core.md | sed -n '112,180p'\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://relux-works.github.io/curator-spec/schemas/v1/agent-skill-v1.schema.json\",\n  \"title\": \"agent-skill.json schema 1\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"schema_version\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"schema_version\": {\"const\": 1},\n    \"commands\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"propertyNames\": {\"$ref\": \"common.schema.json#/$defs/identifier\"}, \"additionalProperties\": {\"$ref\": \"common.schema.json#/$defs/command\"}}\n  },\n  \"allOf\": [\n    {\"not\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"required\": [\"runtime_roots\"]}, {\"required\": [\"dependencies\"]}, {\"required\": [\"capabilities\"]}]}}\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": true\n}\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://relux-works.github.io/curator-spec/schemas/v1/common.schema.json\",\n  \"title\": \"Curator Protocol common definitions\",\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"identifier\": {\n      \"allOf\": [\n        {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9._-]*[A-Za-z0-9_-])?$\", \"maxLength\": 128},\n        {\"not\": {\"pattern\": \"^(?:[Cc][Oo][Nn]|[Pp][Rr][Nn]|[Aa][Uu][Xx]|[Nn][Uu][Ll]|[Cc][Oo][Mm][1-9]|[Ll][Pp][Tt][1-9])(?:\\\\.|$)\"}}\n      ]\n    },\n    \"portablePath\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"maxLength\": 4096,\n      \"pattern\": \"^[^/\\\\\\\\:\\\\u0000-\\\\u001f\\\\u007f-\\\\u009f](?:[^\\\\\\\\:\\\\u0000-\\\\u001f\\\\u007f-\\\\u009f]*[^/ .\\\\\\\\:\\\\u0000-\\\\u001f\\\\u007f-\\\\u009f])?$\",\n      \"not\": {\"pattern\": \"(?:^|/)(?:\\\\.{1,2}|[Cc][Oo][Nn]|[Pp][Rr][Nn]|[Aa][Uu][Xx]|[Nn][Uu][Ll]|[Cc][Oo][Mm][1-9]|[Ll][Pp][Tt][1-9])(?:\\\\.|/|$)|//\"}\n    },\n    \"nonEmptyString\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"maxLength\": 8192},\n    \"projectAlias\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"maxLength\": 128, \"pattern\": \"^[^\\\\u0000-\\\\u001f\\\\u007f-\\\\u009f]+$\"},\n    \"locale\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"maxLength\": 64, \"pattern\": \"^[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9-]{0,62}[A-Za-z0-9])?$\"},\n    \"safeInteger\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": -9007199254740991, \"maximum\": 9007199254740991},\n    \"nonNegativeSafeInteger\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0, \"maximum\": 9007199254740991},\n    \"sha256\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$\"},\n    \"hex256\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[0-9a-f]{64}$\"},\n    \"commit\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[0-9a-f]{40}(?:[0-9a-f]{24})?$\"},\n    \"timestamp\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}Z$\"},\n    \"stringSet\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"uniqueItems\": true},\n    \"identifierSet\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/identifier\"}, \"uniqueItems\": true},\n    \"pathSet\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/portablePath\"}, \"uniqueItems\": true},\n    \"ref\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"kind\", \"value\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"kind\": {\"enum\": [\"tag\", \"revision\"]},\n        \"value\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"maxLength\": 1024, \"pattern\": \"^[^\\\\s\\\\^~><*]+$\"}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"devRef\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"kind\", \"value\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"kind\": {\"enum\": [\"tag\", \"revision\", \"branch\"]},\n        \"value\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"maxLength\": 1024}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"scriptCommand\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"type\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": {\"const\": \"script\"},\n        \"unix_path\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/portablePath\"},\n        \"win_path\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/portablePath\"}\n      },\n      \"anyOf\": [{\"required\": [\"unix_path\"]}, {\"required\": [\"win_path\"]}],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"systemCommand\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"type\", \"command\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": {\"const\": \"system\"},\n        \"command\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/identifier\"},\n        \"hint\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/nonEmptyString\"}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"command\": {\"oneOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/scriptCommand\"}, {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/systemCommand\"}]},\n    \"legacySkillCommand\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"type\", \"skill\", \"command\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": {\"const\": \"skill\"},\n        \"skill\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/identifier\"},\n        \"command\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/identifier\"},\n        \"hint\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/nonEmptyString\"}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"capabilities\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"network\": {\n          \"oneOf\": [\n            {\"const\": \"none\"},\n            {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"pattern\": \"^[^\\\\s/\\\\\\\\]+$\"}, \"uniqueItems\": true}\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"none\"\n        },\n        \"filesystem\": {\n          \"oneOf\": [\n            {\"enum\": [\"repo\", \"home-config\"]},\n            {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/pathSet\"}\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"repo\"\n        },\n        \"exec\": {\n          \"oneOf\": [{\"const\": \"none\"}, {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/identifierSet\"}],\n          \"default\": \"none\"\n        },\n        \"secrets\": {\n          \"oneOf\": [{\"const\": \"none\"}, {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/stringSet\"}],\n          \"default\": \"none\"\n        },\n        \"env_read\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*$\"},\n          \"uniqueItems\": true,\n          \"default\": []\n        },\n        \"prompt_scope\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/nonEmptyString\"}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"skillRequirement\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"git\", \"ref\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"git\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/nonEmptyString\"},\n        \"ref\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/ref\"},\n        \"mode\": {\"enum\": [\"full\", \"runtime\", \"context\"], \"default\": \"full\"},\n        \"commands\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1, \"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/identifier\"}, \"uniqueItems\": true}\n      },\n      \"allOf\": [\n        {\"if\": {\"required\": [\"commands\"]}, \"then\": {\"properties\": {\"mode\": {\"const\": \"runtime\"}}, \"required\": [\"mode\"]}}\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"mcpRequirement\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"hint\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"hint\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/nonEmptyString\"},\n        \"transport\": {\"enum\": [\"stdio\", \"http\"]},\n        \"required_in\": {\"enum\": [\"any\", \"all\"], \"default\": \"any\"}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"dependenciesV2\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"commands\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": {\"oneOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/systemCommand\"}, {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/legacySkillCommand\"}]}}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"dependenciesV4\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"commands\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": {\"oneOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/systemCommand\"}, {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/legacySkillCommand\"}]}},\n        \"skills\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/skillRequirement\"}}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"dependenciesV5\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"commands\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": {\"oneOf\": [{\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/systemCommand\"}, {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/legacySkillCommand\"}]}},\n        \"skills\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/skillRequirement\"}},\n        \"mcp_servers\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/mcpRequirement\"}}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"signature\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"algorithm\", \"key_id\", \"signature\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"algorithm\": {\"const\": \"ed25519\"},\n        \"key_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[0-9a-f]{16}$\"},\n        \"signature\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[A-Za-z0-9+/]{86}==$\"}\n      },\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"canonicalValue\": {\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\"type\": \"null\"},\n        {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n        {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/safeInteger\"},\n        {\"type\": \"string\"},\nsurface without attempting language-tag canonicalization.\n\nFor a selected consistent locale, a manager replaces only the `description`\nand `triggers` values in installed `SKILL.md`, preserving `name` and body. List\nitems beginning with `- ` outside fenced code blocks form the trigger list.\nWhen present, `agents/openai.yaml` is rendered from `display_name`,\n`short_description`, and `default_prompt`. If the selected locale is\nunavailable, source context is installed unchanged and a warning lists the\navailable consistent locales. The warning is emitted even for an otherwise\ncurrent installation.\n\n## 4. Skill manifest\n\n`agent-skill.json` is OPTIONAL for a pure context skill and otherwise conforms\nto exactly one of `agent-skill-v1.schema.json` through\n`agent-skill-v5.schema.json`. The legacy filename `csk-skill.json` has exactly\nthe same object shape; its unchanged `csk-skill-v1.schema.json` through\n`csk-skill-v5.schema.json` series remains the compatibility contract.\n\nReaders resolve manifests in this order:\n\n1. When only `agent-skill.json` exists, read it.\n2. When only `csk-skill.json` exists, read it as a legacy manifest.\n3. When both exist, parse and validate both independently. They MUST represent\n   equal JSON values: object member order and insignificant whitespace are\n   ignored, array order and JSON value types remain significant. If equal,\n   `agent-skill.json` is authoritative. If unequal, the reader MUST fail with\n   `conflicting_skill_manifests` and MUST NOT install either value.\n4. The existence of an invalid modern manifest is an error and MUST NOT fall\n   back to the other filename or to `agents/runtime.json`.\n\n| Schema | Added behavior |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | exported script and system commands |\n| 2 | `runtime_roots`, command dependencies, strict top-level fields |\n| 3 | REQUIRED capability declaration |\n| 4 | transitive skill requirements |\n| 5 | MCP server requirements |\n\nVersion gates are downward: a field introduced by a later version MUST be\nrejected in an earlier one. Schema 1 preserves its deployed extension behavior;\nschemas 2 through 5 reject unknown fields.\n\n### 4.1 Runtime roots and commands\n\nEvery runtime root and script command path MUST be a portable relative path\nthat exists in the snapshot. Runtime roots MUST name directories, be unique,\nand be pairwise disjoint. For schema 2 and later, every script command path\nMUST fall within one declared runtime root when any roots are declared.\n\nA script command declares at least one of `unix_path` and `win_path`. A system\ncommand declares a non-empty bare executable name and MAY include a hint. A\nmissing system command fails installation with the hint. The command name is\nthe shim name and one active name has exactly one owner.\n\n### 4.2 Capabilities\n\nSchema 3 and later require `capabilities`. Capabilities are an audit surface,\nnot a runtime sandbox:\n\n- `network`: `\"none\"` or unique host globs without whitespace or path syntax;\n- `filesystem`: `\"repo\"`, `\"home-config\"`, or unique portable paths;\n- `exec`: `\"none\"` or unique bare executable names;\n- `secrets`: `\"none\"` or unique non-empty secret identifiers;\n- `env_read`: unique environment-variable names;\n- `prompt_scope`: an OPTIONAL non-empty purpose statement.\n\nMissing OPTIONAL capability fields take their schema defaults.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
