object MUST contain exactly `type`, `driver`, and `source_dir`; the driver\nprotocol/core.md:198:MUST be the closed identifier `go-v1`. `source_dir` MUST be a real, link-free\nprotocol/core.md:202:`go.mod` of `source_dir`. An intervening module is invalid.\nprotocol/core.md:206:MUST NOT select a program, arguments, environment, tags, flags, toolchain,\nprotocol/core.md:207:output path, build script, hook, plugin, generator, or post-build action.\nprotocol/core.md:221:generators, tests, plugins, overlays, external linking, and libgcc fallback are\nprotocol/core.md:227:the working directory. The bootstrap environment MUST start empty except for\nprotocol/core.md:239:For every active build command, with canonical `source_dir` as the working\nprotocol/core.md:248:argument and the output is the manager-derived staging path. During bootstrap\nprotocol/core.md:249:and command builds, the environment MUST set `GOPATH`, `GOMODCACHE`, `GOCACHE`,\nprotocol/core.md:255:After the bootstrap probes, the environment MUST retain the bootstrap settings\nprotocol/core.md:281:last child exits. The one output MUST be a bounded regular file inside manager\nprotocol/core.md:284:post-processing, receipt generation, rollback, or any other reason.\nprotocol/core.md:295:- `env_read`: unique environment-variable names;\nprotocol/core.md:318:If neither modern manifest filename exists, `agents/runtime.json` MAY be read\nprotocol/core.md:423:algorithm identifier `curator-build-source-v1`, including every regular file\nprotocol/core.md:432:SHA-256 with exact ASCII `curator-build-source-v1` followed by `0x00`, then\nprotocol/core.md:443:hash with an empty exclusion list: `curator-build-source-v1` is domain-separated\nprotocol/core.md:487:## 9. Compiled-artifact cache and receipts\nprotocol/core.md:490:object containing schema version 1, driver, the `curator-build-source-v1`\nprotocol/core.md:491:identity, `build_root`, command name, `source_dir`, native GOOS/GOARCH/tuning,\nprotocol/core.md:518:env